WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
These are all dividends

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,320
Brother Fang Yang said

3
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,920
How much money can you make by robbing?

4
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:09,380
Our immortal sins are much faster than that, don’t be afraid

5
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:13,540
Did you tell mother what you did?

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,260
I am a craftsman here

7
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,220
Doing the crime of immortality with Brother Fang Yang

8
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,980
No money spent elsewhere

9
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,180
And what I told you before

10
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:26,780
The five hundred taels I spent to buy raw materials are gone.

11
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,500
How much did you earn today?

12
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:29,900
I'll give you these dividends

13
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,900
One hundred and twenty-three thousand six hundred and ninety taels, Brother Yang said

14
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,780
30% should be reserved for later operations

15
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:37,840
Brother Fang Yang also said

16
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,160
Dividend will be paid once in the next month

17
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,360
Approximately several thousand to ten thousand taels per month

18
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:45,700
At least because Brother Fang Yang said

19
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,180
It will never be as popular as it is today.

20
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:53,140
If he signs a share document with me, he will not lie to my father, Brother Fang Yang said.

21
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:55,180
If you don't agree, he will return the craftsmen to us.

22
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:59,700
Tomorrow, the child will go to him and ask someone to return the shares to him.

23
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,020
But my child doesn’t want to draw a clear line between me and Brother Fang Yang.
